{
  "name": "EU & France Public Tenders Watcher (TED v3 + BOAMP) -> Google Sheets & Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-daily-8am",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~eu-public-tenders-ted-boamp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"sources\": [\"ted\", \"boamp\"],\n  \"countries\": [\"FRA\", \"DEU\", \"BEL\"],\n  \"cpvCodes\": [\"72\"],\n  \"publishedSince\": \"{{$now.minus({days: 2}).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\",\n  \"scope\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"maxResultsPerSource\": 25\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-ted-boamp-call",
      "name": "Fetch EU TED + BOAMP Tenders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-buyer-contact-or-high-value",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.tenderId}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-tenders",
      "name": "Keep Valid Tenders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Tenders",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "tenderId": "={{$json.tenderId}}",
            "source": "={{$json.source}}",
            "country": "={{$json.buyerCountry}}",
            "published": "={{$json.publicationDate}}",
            "deadline": "={{$json.deadlineDate}}",
            "buyerName": "={{$json.buyerName}}",
            "buyerEmail": "={{$json.buyerEmail}}",
            "buyerPhone": "={{$json.buyerPhone}}",
            "title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "estimatedValue": "={{$json.estimatedValue}}",
            "noticeUrl": "={{$json.noticeUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "tenderId"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1020,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"New EU/FR Tender [{{$json.source}} | {{$json.buyerCountry}}]: *{{$json.title}}*\\nBuyer: {{$json.buyerName}} ({{$json.buyerEmail || 'no email'}})\\nDeadline: {{$json.deadlineDate || 'N/A'}} | Est. Value: {{$json.estimatedValue || 'N/A'}} {{$json.currency || ''}}\\nLink: {{$json.noticeUrl}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-alert",
      "name": "Send Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EU TED v3 & BOAMP Tender Watcher\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` (free Apify tier includes $5/mo credits) and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n2. Edit `countries`, `cpvCodes`, and `sources` in **Fetch EU TED + BOAMP Tenders**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in **Upsert into Google Sheets** and run a manual test before activating.",
        "height": 195,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Idempotent Upsert\n- **Keep Valid Tenders** drops empty records.\n- **Upsert into Google Sheets** matches on `tenderId`, so the 2-day rolling window never creates duplicate rows.\n- Buyer email, phone, deadline, and official TED/BOAMP URL are sent to Slack.",
        "height": 165,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-output",
      "name": "Deduplication & Routing Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch EU TED + BOAMP Tenders",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch EU TED + BOAMP Tenders": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid Tenders",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid Tenders": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send Slack Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-eu-tenders-template-v1"
  }
}
